  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "According to BODMAS,\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/30c7bcce9b896127d63835306542411e18560fe4d0784e6e5bf2cfcbbf8e2840.png] \n\nGiven: 12 * 6 * 54 * 6 * 7 = 70\n\n**1) ⇒ ×, -, ÷, +**\n\n**⇒ 12 × 6 - __54 ÷ 6__ + 7 = 70**\n\n**⇒ __12 × 6__ - 9 + 7 = 70**\n\n**⇒__ 72 __- 9 __+ 7 __= 70**\n\n**⇒__ 79 - 9__ = 70**\n\n**⇒ 70 = 70 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n**2)** ⇒ ÷, +, ×, -\n\n⇒ **__12 ÷ 6__** + 54 × 6 - 7 = 70\n\n⇒ 2 + __**54 × 6**__ - 7 = 70\n\n⇒__** 2 + 324 **__- 7 = 70\n\n⇒__** 326 - 7**__ = 70 \n\n⇒ 319 ≠ 70 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**3) **⇒ ÷, +, -, ×\n\n⇒ __**12 ÷ 6**__ + 54 - 6 × 7 = 70\n\n⇒ 2 + 54 - __**6 × 7**__ = 70\n\n⇒ __**2 + 54**__ - 42 = 70\n\n⇒ __**56 - 42**__ = 70\n\n⇒ 14 ≠ 70 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**4)** ⇒ -, +, ÷, ×\n\n⇒ 12 - 6 +__** 54 ÷ 6**__ × 7 = 70\n\n⇒ 12 - 6 +__** 9 × 7**__ = 70\n\n⇒__ **12**__ - 6 __**+ 63 **__= 70\n\n⇒ __**75 - 6**__ = 70\n\n⇒ 69 ≠ 70 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"option (1)\".**",
